  "byline": null,
  "publishedAt": null,
  "contentHtml": "<figure><a href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">\n<img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/%24s_!w6Is!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5de5d442-0449-4f37-a82b-7e09457b3074_2756x748.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"395\" data-size=\"normal\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\">\n\n\n</a></figure>\n<p>In this space on Saturdays, I <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/t/roundup\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">do a weekly round-up</a> of sorts: Sifting through what I wrote that you might have missed during the week, what I’ve been reading and watching myself, and some other fun things that have been going on.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/subscribe?\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h4>📝 What I did this week</h4>\n<p><em>Here are the things I wrote or podcasted about during the previous week, sorted in descending order by quality, popularity and/or current relevance.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/2026-27-english-premier-league-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">⚽ 2026-27 English Premier League Tracker 📈</a></strong> - Ahead of the 2026-27 Premier League season, I put out this EPL odds aggregator that combines multiple markets into a consensus set of probabilities to be relegated, finish high in the table and/or win the championship.</p></li>\n<li><p>🏀 <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/russell-westbrook-collected-so-many\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Russell Westbrook Collected So Many Stats, He Broke Them</a></strong> - Following Russ’s retirement, I took a look back at how he weaponized the triple-double to win an MVP and rewrite the NBA record books — while simultaneously altering how we evaluate the box-score (and exposing its ultimate limits).</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/the-white-sox-are-a-miracle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The White Sox Are a Miracle</a></strong> - Just a few years after squandering their future core, hitting rock-bottom and piling up triple-digit-loss seasons, Chicago has pulled off an unbelievable turnaround to top the AL Central — doing it with a revamped roster literally featuring zero players from their 2021 core.</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/are-the-tigers-having-the-most-confusing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Are the Tigers Having the Most Confusing — and Secretly Consequential — Season Ever?</a></strong> - Apparently I’m obsessed with the AL Central… Anyway, despite trading Tarik Skubal at the deadline and hovering below .500, Detroit boasts elite underlying metrics that have kept them right on the fringe of the wild-card race — making them one of the most bizarre, streaky and maybe disproportionately consequential teams in modern baseball history. (I explain in the piece.)</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/seattle-and-toronto-played-an-october\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Seattle and Toronto Played an October Epic. A Year Later, They’re Sharing an Epic Drop-off.</a></strong> - A year after staging an instant classic in the ALCS, both Seattle and Toronto are suffering through massive hangovers marked by embarrassing on-field blunders, historic individual HR drop-offs and rapidly-dwindling playoff hopes. What happened?</p></li>\n<li><p>⚾ <strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/mlbs-trade-deadline-somehow-made\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">MLB’s Trade Deadline Somehow Made Everything More Confusing</a></strong> - Instead of clarifying who was good or bad through buying and selling, the trade deadline only muddied the MLB waters further, leaving baseball with a historic logjam around the wild-card cutline as we head toward the stretch run.</p></li>\n<li>\n<p><span>🏁 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.nascar.com/news-media/2026/08/20/did-joey-logano-just-go-from-chase-bubble-to-title-contender-again/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Did Joey Logano just go from Chase bubble to title contender (again)?</a></strong><span> - </span>At , I dug into how Joey Logano turned around a nightmare start to his season — going from nearly out of the playoff bubble back to a legitimate championship threat after a big win at Richmond to cap a dominant seven-week stretch.</p>\n<ul><li><p>🏁🎙️ <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/5Xb7NWWgIQYUGAMKI2nENn?si=vdU5rgORSdqv_3rTF6RZlw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Podracing: Somehow, Joey Logano Returned</a></strong> - In this week’s , <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tyler-lauletta-b0399667/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> Lauletta</a> and I talked about Joey’s win and recent hot streak — and how another title for the No. 22 would be arguably the most vindicating title in NASCAR history. Then we pivoted to look ahead at the “Magic Mile” in New Hampshire, where Logano might do more damage… but not if Denny Hamlin, Ryan Blaney or Christopher Bell have anything to say about it.</p></li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>📊 Charts of the week:</h4>\n<p>Here were my favorite items of the week from <em><strong><a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/scoreboard-newsletter-archives\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scoreboard</a></strong></em>, my daily newsletter for <a href=\"https://sherwood.news/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Sherwood News</a>… </p>\n<p>🏁<strong> </strong><em><strong>On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/back-on-track\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Kimi Antonelli’s rise</a> in the F1 odds…</strong></em></p>\n<div></div>\n<p><strong>🏈</strong><em><strong> On the NFL’s <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/international-football\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">most popular international-game sites</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/0Yj3W/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d851ec79-9fe3-4c39-bf36-11677ee28fe2_1220x1024.png\" alt=\"Where has the NFL played internationally?\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Where has the NFL played internationally?</p></div>\n<p><strong>⚾</strong><em><strong> On the <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/weve-solved-nothing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">legacy of the late Tommy John</a>…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/RFBMr/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f245773c-8fe1-4ee2-b4c9-0ce554c77d02_1220x972.png\" alt=\"The rise of Tommy John surgery\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>The rise of Tommy John surgery</p></div>\n<p><strong>⚽</strong><em><strong> On <a href=\"https://neilpaine.substack.com/p/international-football\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">how Arsenal compares</a> with other preseason EPL favorites…</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"reader-datawrapper\"><a href=\"https://datawrapper.dwcdn.net/mzTrn/1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/71a886f2-d332-4e1e-b9da-9c93ff244571_1220x1134.png\" alt=\"Arsenal is a big favorite... by non-Man City standards\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><p>Arsenal is a big favorite... by non-Man City standards</p></div>\n<p><em>Subscribe to <strong>Scoreboard</strong> by <strong><a href=\"https://join.sherwood.news/scoreboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">clicking here</a></strong>!</em></p>\n<h4>👀 Some interesting things I read/watched this week</h4>\n<p><em>A collection of articles (with a heavy focus on my fellow Substackers), videos and other media that I enjoyed and/or found thought-provoking over the past week. I don’t always 100% agree with or endorse what’s linked here… but that’s also sort of the point.</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><p><span>⚾</span><strong><a href=\"https://ritmica1.substack.com/p/we-still-dont-really-understand-value?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5688290&amp;post_id=212096888&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“We Still Don’t Really Understand Value. Or Do We?”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://www.wsj.com/sports/baseball/matt-wilkinson-tugboat-giants-ca34ebab\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“His Name Is Tugboat. He Throws an ‘Invisiball.’ And Now He’s a Major-Leaguer.” </span></a></strong><span>by Jared Diamond</span></p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://www.si.com/mlb/the-glow-is-off-at-shortstop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The Glow Is Off at Shortstop”</span></a></strong><span> by Tom Verducci</span></p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾</span><a href=\"https://pauldwhite.substack.com/p/jorge-posada-is-big-mad?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1409578&amp;post_id=209565858&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span> “Jorge Posada is Big Mad”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚾ </span><a href=\"https://baseballprojection.substack.com/p/how-to-supply-a-productive-outfield?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5914842&amp;post_id=211488518&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“How to Supply a Productive Outfield Without Paying for One: Lessons from Tampa Bay”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚾ </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.bravestoday.com/p/the-missing-piece-in-the-braves-pitching?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2943888&amp;post_id=211488862&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The Missing Piece in the Braves’ Pitching Lab Is Velocity”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p>⚾▶️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zygrScsswKs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zygrScsswKs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alcohol, Drugs, Strippers &amp; Dingers - The ‘93 Phillies INSANE Run To The World Series”</a> </strong>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@PressBoxChronicles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Press Box Chronicles</a> ( )</p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://thespade.substack.com/p/what-exactly-makes-a-good-nfl-kicker?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1892935&amp;post_id=211204183&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“What Exactly Makes a Good NFL Kicker and Punter?”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://gridirondeepdive.substack.com/p/which-types-of-passes-drive-nfl-offensive?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1522762&amp;post_id=201494407&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Which Types of Passes Drive NFL Offensive Efficiency?”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏈 </span><a href=\"https://frontporchsports.substack.com/p/can-kentucky-football-become-the?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1460693&amp;post_id=212110156&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Can Kentucky football become the next Indiana?”</span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏈 </span><strong><a href=\"https://blessyourchart.substack.com/p/193-share-of-the-preseason-ap-top?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1185822&amp;post_id=211785176&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Share of the preseason AP Top 25 poll”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏈</span><strong><a href=\"https://spreadsheetsandtailgates.substack.com/p/offseason-deep-dive-notre-dame-defense?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=3545990&amp;post_id=203306315&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Offseason Deep Dive: Notre Dame Defense”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p>🏈▶️ <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8vtX50hnGpY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“</a><strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8vtX50hnGpY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Peyton Manning in High School: Isidore Newman vs Episcopal 1993”</a></strong> by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@CoxSportsTV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YurView - Gulf South Sports</a> <em>(In honor of <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XDw2AGfaOMw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">his son Marshall’s HS debut</a>)</em></p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚽ </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.expectinggoals.com/p/the-cost-of-europe-why-manchester?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2251486&amp;post_id=211375779&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“The Cost of Europe: Why Manchester United may pay a price for finishing third”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>⚽ </span><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/7526138/2026/08/20/ted-lasso-womens-soccer-resources-review/?source=dailyemail&amp;campaign=601983&amp;userId=295087&amp;source=dailyemail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“What ‘Ted Lasso’ gets right about the lack of resources allocated to women’s soccer”</span></a></strong><span>by Asli Pelit</span></p></li>\n<li><p><span>⚽ </span><strong><a href=\"https://originalfootball.substack.com/p/american-owners-spent-years-buying?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2576039&amp;post_id=211688410&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“American Owners Spent Years Buying Football. Now They're Starting to Sell.”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏀 </span><strong><a href=\"https://carlonistudios.substack.com/p/holy-patches?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=7964710&amp;post_id=211741275&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“Holy Patches: The jersey patch wave taking over college athletics” </span></a></strong><span>by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p>🏀▶️ <strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ELy9Q8kvjZE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Which NBA teams deserve more National TV games?”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏀 </span><strong><a href=\"https://www.truehoop.com/p/david-thorpes-2026-2027-nba-projections?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=5973&amp;post_id=211988628&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“David Thorpe’s 2026-2027 NBA projections”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><span>🏒 </span><strong><a href=\"https://corsichronicles.substack.com/p/pwhl-analytics?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=2057972&amp;post_id=207912112&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“PWHL Analytics”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏒 </span><a href=\"https://thehockeywriters.substack.com/p/nhl-revenue-sharing-overhaul-explained?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=1563907&amp;post_id=211482885&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=gwh9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>“NHL Revenue Sharing Overhaul Explained: How the New CBA Changes the Money Game for Rich and Poor Teams in 2026-27”</span></a></strong><span> by </span> </p></li>\n<li><p><strong>🏒 <a href=\"https://weresobacksports.substack.com/p/hockey-found-its-corner-three\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">“Hockey Found Its Corner Three”</a></strong> by  </p></li>\n<li><p><strong><span>🏁 </span><a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/athletic/7523720/2026/08/20/freedom-250-grand-prix-indycar-washington-dc/?campaign=19498029&amp;source=athletic_breaking_targeted_e